<h1>Your technical resume as JSON</h1>
<p>Impress your future employer with a delightful, modern-looking resume generated from a json file in your Github/Gitlab profile. You do not beleive me? Check out mine (this <a href="https://github.com/dobrinov/me/blob/main/cv.json" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">json file</a> turns into a <%= link_to 'web page', submission_path(method: 'github', username: 'dobrinov') %> and/or a <%= link_to 'pdf file', submission_path(method: 'github', username: 'dobrinov', format: 'pdf') %>).</p>

